{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80a2544b01aa066163a9a9ec106bedad2a0f1a0ab7d17249d3ea0f8101417e33",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:529b1126cf7d827e7fb7c89563d37f735b9693a7a18953efdd70f80563d46a2f",
      "text": "燃烧生命",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e1934e39498feb1d1019554fa27482026c9332f22282e844377b7cd5a1d27e1",
      "text": "翔真收到了一份舞台剧替角演出的委托。虽然是个难度极高的差事，但听闻委托人的名字后，翔真决定接下这份工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:529b1126cf7d827e7fb7c89563d37f735b9693a7a18953efdd70f80563d46a2f",
      "text": "燃烧生命",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ed81ac4546a71c6aacf6ba11bc3607367e72066dddde93951db0521e69de6be",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱♪\n我来啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cacc7c8eb8a66eb46d2460146b57fc248a4a7b617fb7cf163dc0d66313e4af77",
      "text": "这么突然叫我过来，真少见啊。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6a904e9a2ed5817c313dd13786098b6ecfbea8e7d0ac7eeaac86374c4e4167",
      "text": "翔真先生，谢谢您能赶过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15a045420ba043118ef780d9d7646dd25f394054f590f31703e017bd04382322",
      "text": "其实……翔真先生也知道某位舞台剧演员\n因骨折住院的新闻吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f068e6af1892c609a0e54c2a228313485b3092c5c633ea51bfede8a290644b78",
      "text": "嗯，昨天的新闻对吧。\n明明舞台剧的首演在即……一定很不甘心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:156dc482008831bf65289af8d4b840d974d8f67516d2e52583b4a09d1ffb808c",
      "text": "今天的谈话，跟这件事有关吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25779d7d465e478c6ee7bf451b43a11afff4311c9d0d31fd4d6f6806227be116",
      "text": "是的。其实那位演员预定出演的舞台剧，\n向翔真先生发来了替角演出的委托……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e729652affa7ee75c2749a05155ea532b9c9583581315578e2e5d6d714e6b7a",
      "text": "……原来如此。我倒是很想帮个忙，\n而且既然是指名那就更不用说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fdfb36326d20d650301e4229b67f4bc084c2dd3cb0fab9e55293e132e564f62",
      "text": "不过那出戏的日程，如果我没记错的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000076682b47f73e79e55f156dcee61544a47d598f4da096092fd7462e272ac8",
      "text": "是的。首演在3天后。而且后天就有一场\n会有媒体采访的公开总彩排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb1a02474d12707f4af76265c59e6706e5c7616377c94178f17a56a631db28ce",
      "text": "这么说能用来准备的时间只有明天的1天……\n不，算上今天的话是2天吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cfb354f126801da7df04de5973348c23b5217a3fc0722f9404f2242bbe25168",
      "text": "要接下这份工作的话，\n就必须做好相当的心理准备了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a135b6d889a3d5b89ab73119f644488375c5632d1884a8c3fe11fe096557fcc3",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n这次的委托，我可以问问是谁提出来的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b67c955c28c690455ca3479f62238dd8cf646c41f2f2deb4181b0f564a4fd1a",
      "text": "是演员市川白鹤先生，这次舞台剧的座长。\n听说他是翔真先生歌舞伎演员时代的朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cde86307b058dc70bfbe5f81dc182e071afe7328ba78cea834fd556cedfd2e77",
      "text": "啊哈哈。\n算不算是朋友还很难说呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0245ff989921d106d29e6acf87ee4777f842885d3904388e924adb481e6fffa4",
      "text": "不过既然是个能让那家伙欠我人情的好机会，\n那我是不是该稍～微努努力了呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天晚上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2d2becaf4e767b597e7a6b6823bc3221cb54c19a130856995a19b90fc1f467",
      "text": "“不，并没有什么深意。\n只是想让您知晓而已……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8ba2a57f5e490719e91213a00abac68b8353456babac1295ce37f8ba75c2af5",
      "text": "“请您安心。\n我，唯有我是永远站在您这边的”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba8630d7a986f25c074ce5eb71936a70531a24841f13f9836dfbb7f9a62cd3ba",
      "text": "……不行呢。还只是拙劣的模仿。\n虽说是临时替角，就算这样也能被原谅吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21159970bb5c5af17f42d09322d69ff71197d66be9ce149292899165ac8c9122",
      "text": "但那样肯定又会被那家伙数落了。\n说什么当了偶像连功夫都荒废了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56fc5d01927c669ac47a8d13a64af82d38f3f058f8a4930ca7ec82ba525ac008",
      "text": "翔真先生，打扰了。明天的碰头会，\n已经成功推迟到下周了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9bae08bb1f8949852e8f4298b0b421abcbabac50956180ace8012dbc83ae59",
      "text": "这样一来，总彩排前的练习时间\n就能最大限度地保证了，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d535e804b6e3894904f9da50dc93adee33568cfec5ac1ec5ca3705c4ccca978a",
      "text": "谢谢你帮忙调整日程呢，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d55ed9c51c5306bf4e5b03a51323bf7947f1a6eca48a3b02e26ff4f1de9c6e8",
      "text": "事情办完的话，你就先回去吧。\n夜已经深了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fa4735473340ae4b45e5dc695108df8f38fdd072160915afe8a4bf58f6f2d46",
      "text": "不，如果翔真先生还要留下来练习的话，\n我也一起留下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e4482182be65fce27f07d9bbff1ba56ae4aae279c145026aa657920393b8baa",
      "text": "要是太勉强自己的话，明天的走位排练\n搞不好会力竭倒下的哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eb993a913b0c4d248067afa74732b4d9c08ac05557534315937bac3af2bb974",
      "text": "为了不让翔真先生变成那样，竭尽全力\n给予支持才是我的工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37c62c1d6c257581c81592ea0170a0530b7e367a4916ad8d49f330218e544595",
      "text": "……呵呵，真是个死脑筋。我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f66677354ae14e4250557044bfca60c9764392dc34507a8c95188b86d777abb",
      "text": "好吧……“既为行家，越是修罗场越要面带笑容”。\n就让我和你一起跨越过去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59dfcab38791ec7518d58198884996b986160c49ffb476e6bf5f2b071914432d",
      "text": "我是华村翔真。\n今天起承蒙各位关照，请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18225ac48a06a54a832a3d761b315d8a3d5007290ef0d26851012712c8ab9dde",
      "text": "翔真酱，干嘛这么客气啊！\n一阵子没见就把我给忘了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ee0c0781cd4f29ad369aa70ab5ecb0b48d717c89695314989acfe946ab3e3bf",
      "text": "哎呀，别来打岔啦。\n刚开始稍微规矩一点又有什么不好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95395a8f0de871100a202a6b98776decfb8aad5b83fec3b7186c14ba657bda66",
      "text": "市川先生真的把华村先生请来了啊。\n能再次一起共事真高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f42682f27c935f6a9ee7a56ed7b01ba1e329349653cb79eda2da6a3b9b8da71",
      "text": "客套话等看完戏再说吧。\n说不定临时抱佛脚的地方马上就要原形毕露了呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a64972d2c730d0a991f280b39017054df559ed4e0bc48379339ff83b47f43692",
      "text": "翔真先生认识的人真多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b7e1fed8114a6bbe06105a8e087a34fa1d38b89a52e7042e1dfdd3a11d039e",
      "text": "因为白鹤酱是座长嘛。\n剧组里很多我认识的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e9cb7300a6a38cd4d367a12f2a677d0237c8618079096bed4dea77ab351e56",
      "text": "……喂，华村。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698e7feaa082fe3a1dd7a78c655f1997cd4c0197c53b94934b13221cdd10260c",
      "text": "哎呀，白鹤酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2acd98956aa83df8ca45910a91bb45181fe2959e15e2f88fb4df99b46db4bddc",
      "text": "喂座长！您也好好\n向华村先生道个谢啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c555b8577f88776665477aa7820068ce86b858ca8ebb79a5288df906b28fad3b",
      "text": "吵死啦。\n虽然是我拜托的，但接下这活的是这家伙自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59ac079c6dfef799fc2b79f6fe87634dd4bfbb93bd0f5c08292a8608bf8399c1",
      "text": "别在我的舞台上拿出轻浮敷衍的演技啊。\n是不是替角毫无关系。观众可是掏了钱来看戏的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67e3bb6e69845e15d58da2a58dd030d268116cbd69b581fda43fb34d87b6eb0c",
      "text": "哎呀呀，不用你说我也清楚。\n正因如此你才来找我的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8037be0d4b04f10e2e602f2e5e6b039cc459540a47d938603bba673d49f29c6a",
      "text": "不管身处怎样的状况，\n豁出命站在舞台上这一点都是不会变的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4924b143e99d6204e1625590a31524d4dcbeff65b776cfde50628e96146a9ac",
      "text": "我怎么可能拿出半吊子的演技来呢。\n这可不是为了你，而是为了我自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bb9b46067d2b6d277558e76860e2e8133df05206bbbce094adc75920c16ba5c",
      "text": "正式演出的前一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47d1197a8baa00232e4a92fbcfd70687955bd3700d9a79f1e850d1dc4c52bb3a",
      "text": "翔真先生，打扰……哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa6226387a5fa65e8d32019227f12a656e3136103f2837096b4c44ae2597335",
      "text": "哎呀讨厌，●●●●プロデューサー酱真是的。\n现在正在敷美容面膜呢，不准偷看哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d57df37db1ca0c0315a1f566e61fc2a9fedd283767d865f4e0028ddcac53a6a0",
      "text": "失礼了，我先在外面等一会儿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba38258f06ea08e0fbda94618a47c3d43e524ff5abf223d68840373b1f341657",
      "text": "谢谢啦。对了，\n也给●●●●プロデューサー酱一片吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8006e1012bfeaebd75c01caf48ef11e1b740f120ab088749091d2ded9284892e",
      "text": "反正我们俩都得顶着缺觉迎来当天，\n至少趁休息时间稍作垂死挣扎一下嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de348d03f83b863b1c843958a892aa8a3c2873cdca27b8514ef398abd0fec95b",
      "text": "谢谢您。我这就用用看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a104bcba38f747dc133aea762850eaa0b6dbc1d625322cad3e6a1b65a89f182",
      "text": "……话说回来，翔真先生真的很厉害。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46611ea934df835240881cf7343a198a9a6f11b63a5e4bde5c25e838a8ff2a28",
      "text": "仅仅凭借公开总彩排里的一出戏，\n就让全场媒体哑口无言了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff4d4412f5f6904fbce4a7c7a84ebc99e61dc06220c3a041e8f551138709ffe6",
      "text": "呵呵，嘛。但说老实话，\n那也只是作秀罢了。不过是演得比较抢眼而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d4a1ab52d4ba190950f06c004295f9bfb5c7d8726fc8d9fac7ad856e20acc71",
      "text": "真要挑刺的话要多少有多少。\n白鹤酱其实早就看穿了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea75d55c5b6f7062e4a6f3c7b45b86e5364379e951ae9b8fd790b9cbc83f6c86",
      "text": "明天正式演出前，必须抓紧一切时间特训才行。\n不然不仅对不起舞台，也对不起观众。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0a70a6faf38fe2ee51308432bae97559d2b00d1c685a1eacbf5fd11c108aa9c",
      "text": "无论是演员，还是各位工作人员，\n还有●●●●プロデューサー酱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b98e289d243604782144309be51a933baa050a17c83dd3479e34eda05c0eee1c",
      "text": "大家都是为了让我站在耀眼的光芒之中，\n才这么努力付出的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7af9852300b25be0c21be36708491f850f5e6fceb732a06543277506733ae67c",
      "text": "……首先是明天的正式演出。\n打起精神来哦，●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9ad75e089e23623c5e1cb102cbf16520c36cace5dfaee0b95cbd793addf847",
      "text": "翔真先生，看午间新闻了吗？\n翔真先生演的舞台剧，引起了极大的反响呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05c6dccde0e22c5fbefaf2a8ce0868faf250d8f4b8314b41571ab19f58e40db2",
      "text": "看了哟，我还录下来看了呢♪\n呵呵呵，被人夸奖我可是很喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7430090177d87ff8c0dc1675ddfa6a1ef7d7bb69987c9ca7999f75f47b14a0f7",
      "text": "虽然我也感觉得出因为是替角而多得了不少印象分，\n稍微有点不甘心就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4632ac5faf7f47abf9982bc555e34182fa580b4940c148f00597b949ce194530",
      "text": "但即便如此，只要来观看的观众能享受舞台带来的乐趣，\n就没有比这更棒的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff6b7e20ea028e25f53d760f8fb2b9f46b5685e049415a8ab0ee321d57632c4c",
      "text": "是的，真的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29ca62961209c1756939a58c21d6865bab3316289a8f8581729030922fb58cba",
      "text": "这次舞台剧的工作虽然困难重重，\n但翔真先生能接下真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dd90d2ef3b8babef2e9b304ca9771db8822e3b0b430bd04bb970938dd6687fa",
      "text": "哎呀，说得好像跟自己无关似的。\n你也是打造出这个舞台的其中一员哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6132a14675d00040c8a59aad06fa92e78e1485c9c3c510d710507a7b0a4f4e28",
      "text": "谢谢你相信我，把这份工作交给我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26841ae7c862ec1afd969176c5eecb1530cacdfa4c221733e73a7abaa22b6523",
      "text": "还有，一直以来支持着我，谢谢你啦，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_018shm_01_1_2_018_01:1_2_018_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09db7be1321871c3213a4d203b07f09d76685c7f9a49cb2769cbefd9beb6e3a7",
      "text": "今后你拿来的工作，\n我也全都会完美拿下的哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
